2369
01:44:53,262 --> 01:44:55,396
Coach Kim finally applauds.

2370
01:44:55,397 --> 01:44:56,431
(Clapping)

2371
01:44:56,732 --> 01:44:59,667
(Applauding without a word)

2372
01:45:02,071 --> 01:45:03,271
I was so proud of her.

2373
01:45:05,942 --> 01:45:07,276
(If you could cover the entire court,)

2374
01:45:07,277 --> 01:45:09,945
(how great would that be?)

2375
01:45:10,613 --> 01:45:13,148
(Hoping Enkhsoyol sees the whole court)

2376
01:45:13,983 --> 01:45:17,319
(Teaching her to aim across the court...)

2377
01:45:17,854 --> 01:45:20,856
(and to hit to the other side)

2378
01:45:21,024 --> 01:45:22,691
Are you just going to stay here?

2379
01:45:22,992 --> 01:45:25,760
("You need to go further.")

2380
01:45:26,229 --> 01:45:29,798
When I got hurt, I felt like
my whole world was falling apart.

2381
01:45:30,166 --> 01:45:31,934
(Bouncing back from her injury)

2382
01:45:31,935 --> 01:45:32,768
Enkhsoyol!

2383
01:45:33,035 --> 01:45:34,736
(Now she can hit wherever she wants!)

2384
01:45:34,737 --> 01:45:36,905
Just as Coach Kim hoped,
Enkhsoyol picks her spot!

2385
01:45:37,106 --> 01:45:38,741
- Right.
- Nice!

2386
01:45:38,742 --> 01:45:39,874
I was like, "I can actually do this."

2387
01:45:39,875 --> 01:45:41,543
I got my confidence back.

2388
01:45:43,513 --> 01:45:46,482
Go get one! How do you attack?

2389
01:45:46,984 --> 01:45:48,550
Go for it and put it away!

2390
01:45:48,551 --> 01:45:50,653
(Shouting at the top of her lungs)

2391
01:45:51,854 --> 01:45:54,623
- Get ready for an overhand pass!
- Hey, the ball might come here.

2392
01:45:54,624 --> 01:45:56,825
Get ready on defense!

2393
01:45:57,994 --> 01:45:59,394
Seung Ju wasn't...

2394
01:46:00,763 --> 01:46:03,064
actually all that scary.

2395
01:46:08,905 --> 01:46:11,673
Honestly, I'd love to see them do that
eight more times.

2396
01:46:12,475 --> 01:46:14,310
(But Ho Geun's words tend to backfire.)

2397
01:46:14,311 --> 01:46:15,477
The score is 7 to 0.

2398
01:46:15,478 --> 01:46:17,645
(Hyo Rim's eighth straight serve)

2399
01:46:19,282 --> 01:46:20,382
The pass is off.

2400
01:46:20,583 --> 01:46:21,883
They can't get an attack going.

2401
01:46:21,884 --> 01:46:23,118
Where are you going with that?

2402
01:46:23,119 --> 01:46:23,985
(On edge)

2403
01:46:23,986 --> 01:46:24,953
Free ball!

2404
01:46:25,188 --> 01:46:26,088
Yu Kyung.

2405
01:46:26,456 --> 01:46:27,289
Run a C!

2406
01:46:27,890 --> 01:46:29,524
Hyo Rim! The court is wide open!

2407
01:46:29,525 --> 01:46:30,325
You have to hit it!

2408
01:46:31,594 --> 01:46:32,717
Enkhsoyol!

2409
01:46:32,718 --> 01:46:33,795
(Right at Seung Ju)

2410
01:46:33,796 --> 01:46:35,430
Can you believe this?

2411
01:46:35,431 --> 01:46:38,266
We need to find a way to attack.
Take charge and hit it!

2412
01:46:40,736 --> 01:46:42,937
(I'll carry this team!)

2413
01:46:43,539 --> 01:46:45,473
(A confident spike for the point)

2414
01:46:45,474 --> 01:46:46,941
(Nice work!)

2415
01:46:46,942 --> 01:46:48,276
What is going on?

2416
01:46:48,511 --> 01:46:50,445
Unbelievable! It's 8 to 0!

2417
01:46:52,615 --> 01:46:55,250
(A crushing spike
against her former captain)

2418
01:46:56,319 --> 01:46:58,654
(Enkhsoyol lights up the deciding set.)

2419
01:47:00,990 --> 01:47:03,024
(She leads them to an 8 to 0 lead.)

2420
01:47:03,025 --> 01:47:05,160
(Yes, Coach!)

2421
01:47:05,161 --> 01:47:08,063
Eight to nothing. Incredible.

2422
01:47:10,066 --> 01:47:12,100
Even scarier than losing is...

2423
01:47:12,201 --> 01:47:13,134
night practice.

2424
01:47:14,704 --> 01:47:16,071
- Yes.
- Exactly.

2425
01:47:18,642 --> 01:47:21,043
Look at the score. It's 8 to 0.

2426
01:47:22,846 --> 01:47:25,480
When the ball is up, make it count.

2427
01:47:26,115 --> 01:47:28,483
Setter, right side!

2428
01:47:28,484 --> 01:47:31,319
- Let's play defense.
- Okay.

2429
01:47:31,820 --> 01:47:32,988
Let's get another one!

2430
01:47:32,989 --> 01:47:35,022
The Wonder Dogs can't get caught up
in the score now.

2431
01:47:35,224 --> 01:47:36,824
They have to play like it's 0 to 0.

2432
01:47:36,825 --> 01:47:38,126
(Hyo Rim's ninth straight serve)

2433
01:47:40,229 --> 01:47:41,063
Na Yeon.

2434
01:47:41,064 --> 01:47:42,597
Cover!

2435
01:47:42,598 --> 01:47:44,132
- Get ready to cover!
- Cover!

2436
01:47:44,401 --> 01:47:46,468
Okay. Get in there!

2437
01:47:47,570 --> 01:47:48,470
She goes up!

2438
01:47:48,471 --> 01:47:49,304
Jump!

2439
01:47:51,674 --> 01:47:54,175
A direct kill!

2440
01:47:54,176 --> 01:47:57,279
(A direct kill)

2441
01:47:57,280 --> 01:47:59,014
It's 9 to 0!

2442
01:47:59,849 --> 01:48:01,717
(Moved)

2443
01:48:01,718 --> 01:48:03,485
My goodness, Ye Dam!

2444
01:48:04,720 --> 01:48:07,155
- That was amazing!
- That was so good!

2445
01:48:07,156 --> 01:48:08,756
The Wonder Dogs have come alive!

2446
01:48:09,158 --> 01:48:12,327
Their targeted serving is working
exactly as planned.

2447
01:48:13,302 --> 01:48:15,970
And their defense and offense are
flawless too.

2448
01:48:17,466 --> 01:48:19,867
The Wonder Dogs are pouring it on
as a team!

2449
01:48:19,868 --> 01:48:21,035
(On a roll)

2450
01:48:21,470 --> 01:48:24,539
(The Wonder Dogs are fully locked in.)

2451
01:48:28,344 --> 01:48:31,379
(Let's keep this momentum going.)

2452
01:48:31,380 --> 01:48:34,716
The Pink Spiders look really rattled.

2453
01:48:36,986 --> 01:48:38,853
We've got to do this!

2454
01:48:40,056 --> 01:48:45,027
(A chance to stretch the lead)

2455
01:48:45,628 --> 01:48:46,995
Hyo Rim steps up to serve.

2456
01:48:46,996 --> 01:48:47,895
(Hyo Rim's tenth straight serve)

2457
01:48:48,564 --> 01:48:50,498
(This time, a serve aimed at Zone 1)

2458
01:48:51,334 --> 01:48:52,268
(Seung Ju is the target.)

2459
01:48:52,269 --> 01:48:53,135
Mine!

2460
01:48:54,203 --> 01:48:55,904
(I've got it.)

2461
01:48:55,905 --> 01:48:57,939
- I'm not going for it.
- Okay, stay there.

2462
01:49:01,811 --> 01:49:03,678
- The pass is off again.
- There we go.

2463
01:49:03,913 --> 01:49:04,980
Da Eun, go!

2464
01:49:05,314 --> 01:49:07,315
(Seung Ju's pass goes off target.)

2465
01:49:07,650 --> 01:49:08,916
They have no choice but to send it over.

2466
01:49:09,252 --> 01:49:10,085
Time to press the attack!

2467
01:49:10,420 --> 01:49:11,853
- Enkhsoyol!
- Shoot it!

2468
01:49:12,989 --> 01:49:14,790
A set to Enkhsoyol on the left!

2469
01:49:14,791 --> 01:49:16,625
(The ball goes to Enkhsoyol.)

2470
01:49:19,829 --> 01:49:22,564
They're scrambling now! Min Ji!

2471
01:49:22,832 --> 01:49:23,732
(Did it get past the block?)

2472
01:49:24,634 --> 01:49:25,934
Can she dig it up?

2473
01:49:27,136 --> 01:49:28,002
Right side!

2474
01:49:28,170 --> 01:49:28,970
C!

2475
01:49:32,108 --> 01:49:34,109
(Left or right?)

2476
01:49:34,944 --> 01:49:35,744
Nice!

2477
01:49:35,745 --> 01:49:37,279
(It's Enkhsoyol!)

2478
01:49:38,381 --> 01:49:42,484
And Enkhsoyol once again!

2479
01:49:47,523 --> 01:49:50,291
- Enkhsoyol!
- What a play!

2480
01:49:50,526 --> 01:49:51,793
(Shouting with joy)

2481
01:49:56,399 --> 01:49:57,832
What a moment!

2482
01:50:01,971 --> 01:50:03,338
(Thrilled)

2483
01:50:03,339 --> 01:50:04,372
(Yes, Coach!)

2484
01:50:04,373 --> 01:50:05,907
(Enkhsoyol, Enkhsoyol, baby!
Wonder Dogs win!)

2485
01:50:05,908 --> 01:50:07,242
(Now that's how you attack!
What are you looking at? That's yours!)

2486
01:50:09,645 --> 01:50:11,112
- Enkhsoyol!
- Enkhsoyol!

2487
01:50:11,447 --> 01:50:12,680
- Enkhsoyol!
- Enkhsoyol!

2488
01:50:13,115 --> 01:50:13,915
It's 10 to 0!

2489
01:50:14,951 --> 01:50:16,317
They've taken it all the way to 10 to 0.

2490
01:50:16,318 --> 01:50:18,052
(Stunned)

2491
01:50:21,991 --> 01:50:23,391
Hyo Rim keeps serving well,

2492
01:50:23,993 --> 01:50:25,727
Ye Eun comes up with a good dig,

2493
01:50:25,728 --> 01:50:28,063
- and Enkhsoyol puts it away.
- Exactly.

2494
01:50:28,064 --> 01:50:29,197
(United as one, they make it 10 to 0.)

2495
01:50:43,012 --> 01:50:46,415
They have all the momentum right now.

2496
01:50:46,416 --> 01:50:48,516
That's right. A 10 to 0 lead is...

2497
01:50:48,752 --> 01:50:51,553
enough to give our players
a real confidence boost.

2498
01:50:51,554 --> 01:50:53,622
Against the Pink Spiders,

2499
01:50:53,623 --> 01:50:55,524
- this shows they can compete.
- Absolutely.

2500
01:50:55,891 --> 01:50:57,792
We had seized the momentum.

2501
01:50:59,061 --> 01:51:00,862
I thought, "We can really do this."

2502
01:51:01,597 --> 01:51:03,464
I'm not the only one playing hurt.

2503
01:51:03,766 --> 01:51:06,901
I went back out there
with a lot of resolve,

2504
01:51:07,069 --> 01:51:09,671
determined to win no matter what,

2505
01:51:10,039 --> 01:51:11,606
and swung at every ball.

2506
01:51:12,141 --> 01:51:15,310
I just wanted to win, somehow.

2507
01:51:15,644 --> 01:51:17,579
I could see how hard she was trying,

2508
01:51:17,580 --> 01:51:20,047
how determined she was to fight.

2509
01:51:20,149 --> 01:51:23,151
I think she could give us real hope.
Something exciting to look forward to.

2510
01:51:23,152 --> 01:51:24,753
(The real battle starts now.)

2511
01:51:24,825 --> 01:51:26,325
Enkhsoyol!

2512
01:51:26,326 --> 01:51:28,827
(The young Mongolian takes
on her seniors.)

2513
01:51:29,314 --> 01:51:30,714
That's it!

2514
01:51:30,715 --> 01:51:32,116
The set goes up. A big swing!

2515
01:51:32,117 --> 01:51:33,917
(Fearless Enkhsoyol...)

2516
01:51:33,918 --> 01:51:36,954
(drives everyone wild.)

2517
01:51:37,822 --> 01:51:38,755
No!

2518
01:51:39,357 --> 01:51:41,191
(The pro team is caught off guard.)

2519
01:51:41,192 --> 01:51:42,192
Hey, come on!

2520
01:51:42,460 --> 01:51:43,527
Hey!

2521
01:51:43,828 --> 01:51:45,929
(Tensions even flare within the team.)

2522
01:51:45,930 --> 01:51:49,700
The Pink Spiders are clearly rattled.

2523
01:51:50,135 --> 01:51:52,002
(An opening!)

2524
01:51:52,604 --> 01:51:53,804
(Fire!)

2525
01:51:54,439 --> 01:51:56,974
(Going for a second reverse sweep)

2526
01:51:57,275 --> 01:51:58,442
I thought, "We can win this."

2527
01:51:58,849 --> 01:52:00,860
I knew we could pull this off.

2528
01:52:00,861 --> 01:52:01,940
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
